This file documents the upgrade steps for devel/nexus3 between major
versions. For minor version upgrades (e.g., 3.93.0.05 to 3.93.0.06),
the upgrade is typically seamless.

When upgrading to a new major version (e.g., 3.94.0.XX):

20250615:
