General upgrade procedure:

1. Backup your data:
   # tar -czf /var/backups/nexus3_pre_upgrade.tar.gz -C /var/sonatype-work nexus3

2. Stop the service:
   # service nexus3 stop

3. If using periodic backups, disable temporarily:
   # rm /usr/local/etc/periodic/daily/nexus-backup.sh

4. Upgrade the port:
   # portupgrade devel/nexus3
   or
   # pkg upgrade nexus3

5. Re-enable backups (if applicable):
   # cp /usr/local/share/examples/nexus/backup.sh /usr/local/etc/periodic/daily/

6. Start the service:
   # service nexus3 start

7. Verify:
   # service nexus3 status
   # curl -s http://localhost:8081/ | head

Rollback procedure:

1. Stop service:
   # service nexus3 stop

2. Restore data:
   # rm -rf /var/sonatype-work/nexus3
   # tar -xzf /var/backups/nexus3_pre_upgrade.tar.gz -C /var/sonatype-work

3. Reinstall old version:
   # pkg remove nexus3
   # pkg add nexus3-OLDVERSION.txz

4. Start service:
   # service nexus3 start
